<title>FINLAND: NORVESTIA SAYS MAY REDEEM ITS OWN SHARES.</title>
<headline>NORVESTIA SAYS MAY REDEEM ITS OWN SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish investment company Norvestia said on Thursday it may redeem its own B-shares starting April 15.</p>
<p>&quot;By redeeming its own shares the company wants to offer an opportunity to those shareholders who do not support the new investment strategy to give up their ownership in the company,&quot; Norvestia said in a statement.</p>
</text>
